eme}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:add243d6dc8fff2ca0e3e44ba02f77872596077d65b70d23ae61db32e1ef1c2d", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:12dac2b64669286153f731a0df3c52ef9bb3edff058c1e653c15cf06a3c6c3ea", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:39f67c1d7e513f2ed336bdf9ddb577cb63ce0488b48878c8a4825f580fbfe228", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a big fppf site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a morphism of this site.\nThe construction above give an equivalence of\ncategories\n<MATHSEG_0001>category of algebraic<MATHSEG_0002>spaces over <MATHSEG_0003>category of pairs <MATHSEG_0004> consisting<MATHSEG_0005>of an algebraic space <MATHSEG_0006> over <MATHSEG_0007> and a<MATHSEG_0008>morphism <MATHSEG_0009> of algebraic spaces over <MATHSEG_0010>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:431342a3ad5cd920b3fcfe2c4669551af517d4be0f9921aa303e4f5a5dcc75f8", "unit_id": "tag:04SG:statement"}
